SUMMARY:Sweet Summer Festival - Cherry-Crest Adventure Farm
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Summer with a Bang – Our Most Spectacular Fireworks Yet!\nJoin us for the Sweet Summer Festival at Cherry Crest Adventure Farm on Saturday\, July 4th—a full day of patriotic fun\, festive flavors\, and family memories. Then\, cap it all off with a fireworks display bigger and brighter than ever before\, lighting up the night sky in red\, white\, and WOW! \nSpend the day enjoying the golden sweetness of farm-fresh corn\, lively music\, festival games\, and all the summer fun you can handle. Savor the aroma of roasted corn\, sip local drinks\, and soak in the sounds of live entertainment-all set in the heart of farm country. \nWhether you’re dancing\, playing\, eating\, or relaxing\, there’s something for everyone to love! \nFestival Highlights:\n\nSweet Corn Specialties & Festival Favorites\nBubble Dance Party\nCorn Crafts\nFestival Games\nLive Music\nLocal Brewery & Winery\nBalloon Artist (TBD)\n\n Fireworks Show at 9:30pm – Our biggest and most spectacular yet! \n– PLUS –Sweet Corn Eating Contest – Whether you’re chomping as a contestant or cheering as a spectator\, it’s sure to be a SWEET time! \n\nFarm: 10am – 10pm\nFestival Activities: 12:00pm – 9:00pm\nFireworks: 9:30pm\n\n\nAdditional Fun Things To Do in Lancaster?\n\n\nKids’ Attractions\nFamily Attractions\nAmish Attractions\n\n\n\nThings To Do for Adults\nHistorical & Educational\nIndoor Things To Do\n\n\n\nTheater\, Music\, & The Arts\nMud Sales\nEvents Calendar\n\n \nTake a look at many more Things To Do throughout Lancaster County!
URL:https://lancasterpa.com/events-calendar/sweet-summer-festival-cherry-crest-adventure-farm-2/
LOCATION:Cherry Crest Adventure Farm\, 150 Cherry Hill Road\, Ronks\, PA\, 17572\, United States
