DESCRIPTION:Check out our amazing lineup of musicians that will be performing live right here at the farm! \nJoin us on select Friday evenings and Saturdays for toe-tapping tunes from our favorite bands. \nAbigail’s Garden plays celtic\, folk\, classical music & more! These sisters (almost Irish twins!) perform an engaging set of songs that express beauty and whimsy\, captivating their audiences. Music that inspires\, heals and makes you giggle! \n\nAdditional Fun Things To Do in Lancaster?\n\n\nKids’ Attractions\nFamily Attractions\nAmish Attractions\n\n\n\nThings To Do for Adults\nHistorical & Educational\nIndoor Things To Do\n\n\n\nTheater\, Music\, & The Arts\nMud Sales\nEvents Calendar\n\n \nTake a look at many more Things To Do throughout Lancaster County!
