SUMMARY:First Saturday in Ephrata
DESCRIPTION:As we continue our quest to “grow the economy” and “build community\,” we’re excited to share how we’re bringing the two goals together with First Saturday! Our First Saturday events celebrate the Ephrata community throughout the downtown area all Summer long. \n2026 Dates\n\nJune 6\nJuly 4\nAugust 1\nSept 5\n\nEvery Friday is a special event somewhere in Lancaster County. Find out more about all the various Friday events in Lancaster County\, PA happening throughout each month. \nEvent Calendar for Lancaster\, PA »\n(click here) \n\nCheck below for a calendar of the upcoming Friday events:\n\nFirst Fridays in Lancaster City\nFirst Friday in Mt. Gretna\nFirst Saturday in Ephrata\nThird Fridays are Music Fridays in Lancaster\nFourth Friday in Columbia\nFourth Friday in Mount Joy\n\nSee our monthly Calendar of Friday Events for descriptions of each. \n\nAdditional Fun Things To Do in Lancaster?\n\n\nKids’ Attractions\nFamily Attractions\nAmish Attractions\n\n\n\nThings To Do for Adults\nHistorical & Educational\nIndoor Things To Do\n\n\n\nTheater\, Music\, & The Arts\nMud Sales\nEvents Calendar\n\n \nTake a look at many more Things To Do throughout Lancaster County!
