SUMMARY:Live Music with The A440’s at Cherry Crest Adventure Farm
DESCRIPTION:Check out our amazing lineup of musicians that will be performing live right here at the farm! \nJoin us on select Friday evenings and Saturdays for toe-tapping tunes from our favorite bands. \nThe A440s are a brass band from Lancaster\, PA\, all about bringing good music\, good vibes\, and good times. They got their start at Millersville University and now you can catch them busking around Lancaster or playing gigs all over the county. Their sound is a fun mix of pop\, rock\, jazz\, funk\, and world music — basically a little bit of everything — and their high-energy shows always get the crowd moving. With deep roots in the Central PA music scene\, The A440s are putting their own fresh spin on brass music and making it impossible not to have a good time. \n\nAdditional Fun Things To Do in Lancaster?\n\n\nKids’ Attractions\nFamily Attractions\nAmish Attractions\n\n\n\nThings To Do for Adults\nHistorical & Educational\nIndoor Things To Do\n\n\n\nTheater\, Music\, & The Arts\nMud Sales\nEvents Calendar\n\n \nTake a look at many more Things To Do throughout Lancaster County!
