UID:10048129-1783382400-1783468799@lancasterpa.com
SUMMARY:Discovery Lab: Then & Now Lab - Tiny Town Summer Camp
DESCRIPTION:Discovery Lab Toddler Camp at Tiny Town is a gentle\, play-based introduction to curiosity and exploration\, created especially for our youngest learners. Designed for children 18 months–3 years\, this camp invites toddlers to explore the world through sensory play\, movement\, music\, and simple hands-on discovery. Join the incredible Ms. Ashley as she brings our families together through educational play! \n\nSCHEDULE\nEach camp day includes 1 hour of themed camp fun (10:00–11:00 AM) plus 2 bonus hours of Stay & Play (until 1:00pm)—that’s 3 hours of entertainment\, learning\, and socialization all for just $5 more than regular admission! \nCome for the crafts\, songs\, stories\, and toddler-friendly activities and then stay to play and explore the town together. It’s the perfect mix of structured fun and free play in a safe\, enriching environment. \nChild must be accompanied by one (1) adult. Choose from 11 weeks of summer camp\, each featuring a uniquely fun and engaging theme that will spark your little one’s curiosity all summer long! \n\nAdditional Fun Things for Kids To Do in Lancaster?\n\n\nSummer Camps\nPetting Zoo\nRailroad Attractions\n\n\n\nFun on the Farm\nAmusement Parks\nMini Golf\n\n\n\nArcades & Video Games\nZip-Lines\nEvents Calendar\n\n \nTake a look at many more Summer Camps offered throughout Lancaster County this summer!
URL:https://lancasterpa.com/events-calendar/tiny-town-summer-camp-then-now-lab/
